      <title>Better Call Sell - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACWW Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/05/better-call-sell/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/05/better-call-sell/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 03:58:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-8996" class="post-8996 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Better Call Sell&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	 	 	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;It was raining in town yesterday, and Chief was being a bit poetic about the wet stuff.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chief-rain.jpg" alt="Chief: Rain tonight... Rain rain rain. My soul! It cries the tears of a million storms!" class="wp-image-8997" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Of course he got mad at me for &amp;#8220;not letting him express any emotion,&amp;#8221; which I didn&amp;#8217;t do at all. But that&amp;#8217;s Chief for you.&lt;em&gt; (And Wild World crankies in general.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Meanwhile, Derwin was reminiscing about the town he grew up in. He said it had a train stop, and there was a monkey who worked at the train station. He&amp;#8217;s clearly referring to Porter, in a nice throwback to the GameCube game. 🐒&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/derwin-monkey.jpg" alt="Derwin: And there was the coolest monkey who worked at the station, derrrr!" class="wp-image-8998" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;A new &amp;#8220;Talking to Myself&amp;#8221; message posted to the bulletin board gave a recipe for homemade water! 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ttm-water.jpg" alt="-Talking to Myself- I filled an empty water bottle with ordinary tap water and... PRESTO! Homemade water!" class="wp-image-9001" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I played again tonight, and it was still raining! ⛈️&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;It was Flea Market day, but I wasn&amp;#8217;t planning on buying anything. But when I saw Pippy&amp;#8217;s Nintendo bench, I was curious to see how much it would cost. It&amp;#8217;s already a very cheap item to begin with, and it&amp;#8217;s one that I&amp;#8217;ll often buy to give as a gift. As it turns out, Pippy was selling it for just 30 bells!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pippy-sell.jpg" alt="Pippy: I call sell you my Nintendo bench for only 30 bells!" class="wp-image-9000" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Typo alert! Better call sell. 😉&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;So of course I bought it, and I&amp;#8217;ll probably regift it once again at some point.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Maple has been sick with a cold this week, so I gave her some medicine yesterday and today. Get well soon, Maple!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/maple-toes.jpg" alt="Maple: I feel better! I... I can feel my toes again! Thank you SO much!" class="wp-image-9003" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Down at the Roost, Mr. K.K. Slider performed &amp;#8220;Mr. K.K.&amp;#8221; for me. Is it an autobiographical song? If only I could understand the lyrics&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/kk-9526.jpg" alt="K.K.: All right, get ready to dig the riffs on this ditty: Mr. K.K.!" class="wp-image-9002" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0ff365ea4b4ae589e18c26b092fe26946a6e14116b63065f41029c8c6138c7c8?s=98&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g' class='avatar avatar-49 photo' height='49' width='49'/&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/05/better-call-sell/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-05T23:58:00-04:00"&gt;September 5, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-06T03:01:28-04:00"&gt;September 6, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt; &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chief-rain.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
